Z||000010||Eric_PA||08-23-2000||06:44 AM||||I have to admit that recently on my way to the Local Pick and Pull I was blown away by a Dodge Spirit. I was in my GT with an Automatic with the 3.33 trans. Off the line I punched it from a stop light, the way I usually drive, then all off a sudden vroom! A four door dodge passes me. I couldn't keep up, and the faster we went the farther back I fell. My friend was laghing so hard. When we finally got next to the car a few miles down the road a cute blonde looks over at us and smiles and takes off again. This just made my buddies day, he was finally falling for a Fiero and this had to happen. I hope the trip to Kick Hill this week changes his mind. I can't wait to get my HO Quad in the car so this doesn't happen again. Also, some of the Neons are fast. Check out this website, <A HREF="http://turbosystem.com/Hahn_Automotive/Neon/neon.html" TARGET=_blank>http://turbosystem.com/Hahn_Automotive/Neon/neon.html</A>   They specialize in turbo systems, I would like to get one for my sunfire someday.<P><BR>Eric<BR>Black 86.5 GT||||reg||1
